# Hook commands in here are absolute, $HOME-specific paths baked in by
# `twing init` (hookBinaryPath()) -- committing it breaks on every machine
# whose $HOME differs from whoever committed it last (hit live, 2026-08-11:
# a checked-in /home/remote/... entry errored with ENOENT on this machine).
# Run `twing init` locally to (re)generate it instead.
